WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.059
PostgreSQL 19 is

00:00:01.871 --> 00:00:02.390
here

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.416
and it fixes

00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:04.064
old pain

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:05.592
The new REPACK

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:06.630
CONCURRENTLY command

00:00:06.441 --> 00:00:07.691
reorganizes tables

00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:08.257
for your current

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:09.731
workload without disrupting

00:00:09.543 --> 00:00:10.816
ongoing operations

00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:11.842
so no more

00:00:11.654 --> 00:00:12.691
downtime just to

00:00:12.503 --> 00:00:13.469
tidy a bloated

00:00:13.281 --> 00:00:13.965
table

00:00:14.494 --> 00:00:15.449
A new pg

00:00:15.261 --> 00:00:16.604
plan advice extension

00:00:16.463 --> 00:00:17.713
gives better control

00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:18.786
over plan stability

00:00:19.022 --> 00:00:20.519
standbys now support

00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:21.899
read-your-writes consistency

00:00:22.029 --> 00:00:23.126
and a get-or-create

00:00:22.937 --> 00:00:24.152
behavior saves a

00:00:23.963 --> 00:00:25.390
network round trip

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:26.782
Also new

00:00:26.842 --> 00:00:28.516
md5 passwords now

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:29.388
trigger a warning

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.178
ahead of removal

00:00:30.309 --> 00:00:31.735
and LZ4 builds

00:00:31.547 --> 00:00:33.068
use lz4 as

00:00:32.879 --> 00:00:33.846
the default TOAST

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:34.459
compression

00:00:34.998 --> 00:00:36.012
Full story on

00:00:35.823 --> 00:00:36.719
the dashboard
